{"seq":17,"slug":"famous-essays-and-quotes","title":"名篇与语录","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/17_famous-essays-and-quotes","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"名篇与语录-简介\">名篇与语录 简介</h1><p>毛泽东的著述中有一批脍炙人口的经典名篇和精辟语录，它们凝练了毛泽东思想的核心要义，以鲜明的观点、生动的语言和深刻的洞察力产生了广泛而持久的影响。这些名篇与语录不仅是理论学习的精华读本，也是理解毛泽东思想精神实质最为直接的文本入口。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于希望快速把握毛泽东核心思想精髓的读者，包括初次接触毛泽东著作的入门学习者、需要在写作和表达中准确引用经典论述的研究者，以及希望从经典语录中汲取实践智慧的一般读者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>毛泽东研究合集中，多数 hub 围绕<strong>一部专著</strong>或<strong>一个思想分支</strong>做系统纵深；本 hub 是其中唯一以「<strong>文本入口 + 语录速查 + 应用转化</strong>」为定位的横切 hub——不追求理论体系的完整性，而追求让读者<strong>快速进入文本、准确检索语录、得体运用经典</strong>。三者分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>本 hub（名篇与语录）</th>\n<th>专著 hub（如矛盾论/论持久战）</th>\n<th>思想分支 hub（如军事/建党思想）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>文本入口、语录速查</td>\n<td>单篇文本的逐层精读</td>\n<td>跨文本的主题理论体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>名篇导读 + 语录索引</td>\n<td>一部著作的完整论证</td>\n<td>一个领域的系统综述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>入门、引用、应用</td>\n<td>深度研读、学术分析</td>\n<td>体系把握、理论研究</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此，当你需要<strong>某条语录的完整论证</strong>或<strong>某部专著的深度展开</strong>时，本 hub 各篇末尾的「延伸阅读」会把你导向对应的专著或思想分支 hub，例如 <a href=\"../on-contradiction/\">矛盾论</a>、<a href=\"../on-practice/\">实践论</a>、<a href=\"../on-protracted-war/\">论持久战</a>、<a href=\"../mao-military-thought/\">毛泽东军事思想</a>、<a href=\"../mao-party-building-thought/\">毛泽东建党思想</a>。各篇范围互不重复：同一事实只在其主篇展开，本 hub 仅做入口与索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构\">章节结构</h2><p>第一章<strong>经典名篇</strong>，精选毛泽东最具代表性的短篇著作进行深度解读，包括《为人民服务》《愚公移山》《纪念白求恩》三篇&quot;老三篇&quot;的精读分析，《在延安文艺座谈会上的讲话》的理论贡献梳理，以及其他必读短篇的导读与赏析。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>主题语录精选</strong>，从哲学方法论、军事战略、治理与群众路线三大主题维度，系统整理毛泽东最具理论深度和实践指导意义的经典语录，为每条语录提供出处背景和思想解析。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>应用指南</strong>，从写作引用和实践智慧两个方面，指导读者如何在当代语境中准确、恰当地运用毛泽东的经典论述，使经典文本的学习转化为实际的表达能力和思维方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>入门读者</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"classic-essays/serve-the-people-bethune-yu-gong\">老三篇精读</a> 建立对核心文本的直观感受，再进入第二章按主题积累语录。无需任何前置知识。</li>\n<li><strong>研究与写作者</strong>：以第二章三篇主题语录为索引层，每条语录顺「延伸阅读&quot;跳转到专著 hub 核对原文，再用 <a href=\"application-guide/writing-citation-guide\">写作引用指南</a> 规范引用。建议先了解 <a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/overview-methodology/comprehensive-overview-159-articles\">毛泽东选集·159篇综览</a> 的版本与篇目体系。</li>\n<li><strong>实践应用者</strong>：可直接从 <a href=\"application-guide/practical-wisdom-modern-use\">实践智慧的现代运用</a> 入手，遇到感兴趣的方法论再回溯第二章语录原文。</li>\n<li><strong>时间有限者</strong>：直接从第二章选择与自身需求最相关的主题（哲学/军事/治理）重点研读即可。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classic-essays","title":"经典名篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/classic-essays","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serve-the-people-bethune-yu-gong","title":"老三篇精读","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/classic-essays/serve-the-people-bethune-yu-gong"},{"seq":2,"slug":"yan-an-forum-talks","title":"在延安文艺座谈会上的讲话","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/classic-essays/yan-an-forum-talks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"other-essential-short-works","title":"其他必读短篇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/classic-essays/other-essential-short-works"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-quotes-thematic","title":"主题语录精选","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/key-quotes-thematic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-methodology-quotes","title":"哲学与方法论语录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/key-quotes-thematic/philosophy-methodology-quotes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"military-strategy-quotes","title":"军事战略语录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/key-quotes-thematic/military-strategy-quotes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"governance-mass-line-quotes","title":"治理与群众路线语录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/key-quotes-thematic/governance-mass-line-quotes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"application-guide","title":"应用指南","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/application-guide","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"writing-citation-guide","title":"写作引用指南","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/application-guide/writing-citation-guide"},{"seq":2,"slug":"practical-wisdom-modern-use","title":"实践智慧的现代运用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/famous-essays-and-quotes/application-guide/practical-wisdom-modern-use"}]}]}